# Early Hints: per-post hero-image "Link: rel=preload" rules are appended to
# dist/_headers (build output) by src/integrations/early-hints-preload.mjs.
# Cloudflare replays them as HTTP 103 once Early Hints is enabled for the zone.
#
# 2026-09: connect-src now also allows https://translate.googleapis.com.
# The reader tools "voice" tab uses it to translate the article chunk by
# chunk when a non-Sinhala reading language is selected. Remove this entry
# if that fallback is ever dropped from reader-tools.js.
#
# MyAdCash (Adcash) ad network REMOVED and replaced with A-ADS. The
# previous acscdn.com / adexchangeclear.com / usrpubtrk.com script-src and
# connect-src entries (required by MyAdCash's aclib.js library and its
# runBanner() XHR calls) have all been removed - A-ADS's ad unit is a
# pure <iframe src="//acceptable.a-ads.com/..."> embed with no external
# JS library and no XHR/fetch calls of its own, so no script-src or
# connect-src addition is required for it.
#
# frame-src remains "https:" wildcard (not a fixed domain list), which
# already covers acceptable.a-ads.com (and any future ad-creative/embed
# domain) without needing a maintained allowlist - the accepted, standard
# trade-off for ad-monetized sites. media-src stays "https:" for the same
# reason.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://comments.wala-katha.workers.dev https://api.web3forms.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://translate.googleapis.com; media-src 'self' https: blob:; frame-src 'self' https:; frame-ancestors 'self'

# Cache lifetimes for assets served from our own origin. Astro hashes JS/CSS
# bundle filenames and site images never change in place (optimize-images.yml
# rewrites a .webp only when its content changes), so a one-year immutable
# cache is safe. The Cloudflare beacon script comes from
# static.cloudflareinsights.com and its cache lifetime cannot be set here.
#
# The footer "Watch Movies" popup opens teraboxpage.com in a new tab (its own
# X-Frame-Options blocks iframes), so it needs no frame-src allowance of its
# own - the frame-src added above exists solely to support ad creative
# iframes, which is a separate, unrelated concern from this popup.
/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.webp
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
